<title>USA: Moody's raises Birdville, Texas, schools to Aaa.</title>
<headline>Moody's raises Birdville, Texas, schools to Aaa.</headline>
<text>
<p>NEW YORK, Jan 21 - Moody's Investors Service - Rating Announcement As of 01/17/97.</p>
<p>Issuer		: Birdville I.S.D. PSF-gtd. Series '97</p>
<p>State		 : TX</p>
<p>Rating		: Aaa</p>
<p>Sale Amount	 : 32,600,000</p>
<p>Expected Sale Date: 01/30/97</p>
</text>
